# "Mills three cards" with fewer than three in the library mills as many as there are (CR 701.17a, 121.4 only loses a
# player who has to draw): Bot2's library holds one card when Brain Freeze resolves on turn 3. It is milled, the library
# is empty, and Bot2 has not lost; losing would take a draw from it on turn 4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Island
Island
Brain Freeze
Island x3
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Mountain
Swamp

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Brain Freeze.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Result = InProgress
Bot2.Library.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Swamp; Mountain
